Load nixpkgs' native EGL before the compositor restricts filesystem access.
ANGLE looks up libEGL.so.1 by SONAME, and the helper does not inherit
LD_LIBRARY_PATH from the browser.

Use the ELF dependency metadata of system graphics drivers to grant read
access to their library directories. Follow dependencies recursively and
include Mesa DRI modules loaded dynamically by EGL.

